        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/{size}/1865_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-02-27T13:27:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>My Tactics FAQ answers a question like that. Pretty sure it just means to put it back in the box, meaning it goes back in the pool of possible tokens he can get out later, not that he can never put out that token ever for the rest of the game.&nbsp;</p>",
